   "text": "Thirty sailors ran back and forth across a brand-new warship. After the third run, the admiral stopped the test, and the ship sailed anyway. It's 1628 in Stockholm. The king, away at war, orders seventy-two heavy cannons for his new warship, the Vasa. So it gets two decks of guns, stacked high above the water, and hundreds of carvings.",
