   "text": "But every run rocks it harder. The admiral wishes the king were home. The king's letters say: get her to sea. On August tenth, a huge crowd watches four sails go up. A gust tips the Vasa over. It rights itself. Then a second gust pushes the lower gun ports under the water.",
